          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A spike in conflict intensity drives governments to enact urgent national‑security measures—export controls, sanctions, and expedited oversight—that increase the tempo and intensity of regulatory interventions targeting AI." />
