          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Improved maritime accessibility lowers trade/frictional risks and commodity/FX volatility and insurance costs, encouraging market‑makers to maintain tighter spreads and deeper books, whereas disruptions cause market‑making pullback and wider bid‑ask spreads." />
          <attvalue for="37" value="0-6 months" />
