          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rapid, widespread deployment of similar AI-driven trading and risk models increases correlated tail risk and short-term volatility, prompting institutional de-risking and lower aggregate appetite for risky assets." />
