          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Higher policy rates raise the cost of debt and increase discount rates used by VCs and corporates, reducing fundraising, valuations and capital available for AI startups and infrastructure, thereby shrinking AI investment flows." />
