          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising policy rates increase short-term borrowing and trade‑finance costs for oil traders and ship operators (higher LC and working‑capital prices), prompting shipment deferments, cancellations and lower cargo throughput through Gulf routes." />
